{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/RandomGraphs\/documentation\/RandomGraphs","doc:\/\/RandomGraphs\/documentation\/RandomGraphs\/Multigraphs","doc:\/\/RandomGraphs\/documentation\/RandomGraphs\/Multigraphs\/DirectedPseudograph"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/RandomGraphs\/documentation\/RandomGraphs\/Multigraphs\/DirectedPseudograph\/scaleFree(vertexCount:alpha:beta:gamma:deltaIn:deltaOut:using:)"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"scaleFree","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"vertexCount","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"n","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"alpha","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = 0.41, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"beta","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = 0.54, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"gamma","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = 0.05, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deltaIn","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = 0.2, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deltaOut","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = 0, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"using","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"generator","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inout","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SG","text":"RandomNumberGenerator","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Multigraphs\/documentation\/Multigraphs\/DirectedPseudograph","preciseIdentifier":"s:11Multigraphs19DirectedPseudographV","text":"DirectedPseudograph","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Béla Bollobás, Christian Borgs, Jennifer Chayes and Oliver Riordan. Directed scale-free","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"graphs. ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Proceedings of the 14th ACM–SIAM Symposium on Discrete Algorithms"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" (SODA 2003),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"132–139.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Note","style":"note","type":"aside"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It starts from the directed cycle 0 → 1 → 2 → 0 and adds one arc per step until there are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertexCount"},{"type":"text","text":" vertices. With probability α the step adds a new vertex v → w; with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"probability β an arc v → w between existing vertices; otherwise (γ) an arc v → w to a new"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertex w. An existing source is drawn with probability proportional to its out-degree plus"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deltaOut"},{"type":"text","text":", an existing target to its in-degree plus "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deltaIn"},{"type":"text","text":": with probability"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"nδ\/(nδ + m) a uniform vertex (new ones included), else the source (or target) of a uniform"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"arc. New vertices take the next number. Self-loops and parallel arcs occur. The arcs are at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"positions "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0..<m"},{"type":"text","text":" in the order they were added, the cycle first."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(m) expected, with m ≈ (n − 3)\/(α + γ) + 3 arcs.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Complexity","style":"note","type":"aside"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertexCount ≥ 3"},{"text":"; α, β and γ positive, summing to 1 within 10⁻⁹; and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deltaIn"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deltaOut"},{"text":" non-negative and finite.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Precondition","style":"note","type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/randomgraphs\/multigraphs\/directedpseudograph\/scalefree(vertexcount:alpha:beta:gamma:deltain:deltaout:using:)"]}],"metadata":{"extendedModule":"Multigraphs","role":"symbol","conformance":{"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Vertex"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}]},"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/RandomGraphs\/ScaleFree.swift#L38","fileName":"ScaleFree.swift"},"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"scaleFree","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"vertexCount","ki